adj[i] = new ArrayList<>();\n        }\n        n = sc.nextInt();\n        m = sc.nextInt();\n        k = sc.nextInt();\n        c = sc.nextInt();\n        d = sc.nextInt();\n        mx = n + k;\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < k; i++) {\n            u = sc.nextInt();\n            add_edge(s, at(u, 0), 0, 1);\n        }\n        for (int i = 0; i <= mx; i++) {\n            add_edge(at(1, i), t, c * i, k);\n        }\n        for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\n            for (int j = 0; j < mx; j++) {\n                add_edge(at(i, j), at(i, j + 1), 0, k);\n            }\n        }\n        for (int i = 0; i < m; i++) {\n            u = sc.nextInt();\n            v = sc.nextInt();\n            for (int j = 0; j < k; j++) {\n                for (int j2 = 0; j2 < mx; j2++) {\n                    add_edge(at(u, j2), at(v, j2 + 1), d * (2 * j + 1), 1);\n                    add_edge(at(v, j2), at(u, j2 + 1), d * (2 * j + 1), 1);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        while (mf < k) {\n            dijkstra();\n            trace();\n        }\n        System.out.println(ans);\n        sc.close();\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.02053336799144745, -0.00047071068547666073, -1.1472419600977446e-06, -8.590104698669165e-05, -3.4121114822482923e-06, -3.128163257315464e-07, -0.0011705794604495168, -0.11762791126966476, -0.001704698195680976, -4.320199877838604e-07, -0.24716465175151825, -0.06997289508581161, -0.00419664429500699, -0.0018818771932274103, -0.1435733437538147, -1.981667537620524e-06, -1.3782830137643032e-05, -6.869017852295656e-06, -3.128163257315464e-07, 0.0, -5.5577775128767826e-06, -5.264322317088954e-05, -2.339278580620885e-06, -2.339278580620885e-06, -0.00011033779446734115, -9.849109119386412e-06, -1.1472419600977446e-06, -2.522638169466518e-05, -0.04301677271723747, -0.03366333618760109, -3.531315314830863e-06, -0.00012023169983876869, -0.00014036978245712817, -0.035569701343774796, -0.375985